class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D408 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mover><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\">→</mo></mstyle><mpadded width=\"+0.833em\" lspace=\"0.278em\" voffset=\"-.2em\" height=\"-.2em\"><mi>d</mi><mspace depth=\".25em\"></mspace></mpadded></mover><mtext> </mtext><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>{#eq-ql-sandwich-limit}</p>\n<p>so that <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.265em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛃</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> behaves as if its\ncovariance were the <strong>sandwich</strong> <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}_n^{-1}\\mathbf{B}_n\\mathbf{A}_n^{-1}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.247em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.239em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msubsup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.247em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.239em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msubsup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, which involves\nthe distribution of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Y}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> only through\nits first two moments.</p></li>\n<li><p>If the variance specification <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-ql-specification\">@eq-ql-specification</span> is correct,\nthen <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{B}_n=\\mathbf{A}_n\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> by <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-ql-score\">@thm-ql-score</span>(d), and\n<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-ql-sandwich-limit\">@eq-ql-sandwich-limit</span> becomes\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}_n^{1/2}(\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}}-\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}^0)\\to\\mathrm{N}_p(\\mathbf{0},\\mathbf{I})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.139em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom><m